==Trivia==
Noctowl is one of four Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion featured in the "Abomasnow of Mt. Coronet" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]] as {{p|Noctowl}} can be found at [[Mount Coronet]] in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}; this may also be the setting for this card's illustration.

===Origin===
*'''Silent Wing''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Noctowl|121}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

